      "title": "Headline verdict",
      "items": [
        "Separate scope recommended for OLM-to-Excel growth",
        "In-place only for a contacts-only MVP with hard caps",
        "Middle option: same-repo module with thin UI wire"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Current app (Observed)",
      "items": [
        "SHA 5abea14 (main tip 2025-06-05)",
        "Single-file Streamlit; matrix + labels + if/elif + fns",
        "Batch ZIP for images and mbox\u2192eml only",
        "No shared text-cell safety or encoding helpers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Flip to in-place only if",
      "items": [
        "Contacts-only forever; no column-mapping UI",
        "No groups/calendar/mail; archives stay under ~200 MB",
        "Real OLM nesting matches the synthetic sample"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Risks",
      "items": [
        "bs4 and markdownify used but missing from requirements",
        "PyPI mailbox\u2260stdlib; OCR needs Poppler+Tesseract",
        "Full-mailbox OLM can exceed upload and RAM limits"
      ]
    }
